1
00:00:06,858 --> 00:00:09,646
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,891 --> 00:00:12,713
=Episode 19=

3
00:00:12,897 --> 00:00:15,720
(Bring it on. I fear nothing!)

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,560
I would never allow you

5
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,720
to bear His Majesty's child.

6
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,560
If you do,

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,760
every last one

8
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,040
must die.

9
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,960
You wicked consort.

10
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,960
Do you know who you've been killing?

11
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,560
They were His Majesty's own blood.

12
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,840
So what?

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,840
So what if you know the truth?

14
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,680
I have the late Empress as my shield.

15
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,440
You two wretches,

16
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,240
what can you do to me?

17
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,600
You wretch!

18
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,840
What can we do?

19
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,200
Murder must be paid for.

20
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,640
You have the late Empress
as your immunity.

21
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:00,560
So what?

22
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,160
Your rank,

23
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:02,840
your dignity,

24
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,640
and your glory.

25
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,840
I will

26
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,720
trample every last one of them,
one by one.

27
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,480
It won't be long

28
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:09,960
before I make you

29
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,320
lose everything you hold dear.

30
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,880
I'll send you to join Noble Consort Hui.

31
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,920
You think you can?

32
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,040
Then bring it on.

33
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,480
I fear nothing.

34
00:01:40,628 --> 00:01:43,880
(Director Li, Li Chengyan's father)

35
00:01:44,461 --> 00:01:46,120
(Despite all treatment, she died
at the hour of Chou, August 20th.)

36
00:01:49,383 --> 00:01:51,417
(Records of the Late Empress)

37
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:58,640
Father.

38
00:02:00,949 --> 00:02:01,683
(Records of the Late Empress)

39
00:02:03,429 --> 00:02:04,677
(Records of the Late Empress)

40
00:02:06,563 --> 00:02:07,990
(Records of the Late Empress)

41
00:02:09,717 --> 00:02:11,040
(Records of the Late Empress)

42
00:02:13,513 --> 00:02:14,313
Father.

43
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,880
Why are you secretly burning
the late Empress's old records?

44
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,800
Was there more to her death?

45
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,600
Father, how could you?

46
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,280
Why did you do this?

47
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,840
You've been secretly obeying
Consort Qi, haven't you?

48
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,560
I've known for a long time.

49
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,720
How could you get tangled in
harem infighting

50
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,200
and become a tool for power?

51
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,520
I had no choice.

52
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:47,560
Back when I was director
at the Imperial Hospital,

53
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:51,320
I noticed something strange
about the late Empress's illness.

54
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,760
Consort Qi found out.

55
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,560
She threatened the lives
of our entire family.

56
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,080
I had no choice but to obey,

57
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,080
to be controlled by her.

58
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,040
So I left the Imperial Hospital.

59
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,360
All these years,

60
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,400
I've been consumed by guilt.

61
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:08,440
I can't sleep well at night.

62
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,080
Father.

63
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,640
In my heart,

64
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,840
you've always been a man of integrity.

65
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,080
Since I was a child, you taught me

66
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,600
that a physician must have compassion,

67
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,160
and heal the world.

68
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,240
Never bow to power,

69
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,520
nor be tempted by wealth.

70
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,120
You said a physician's hands

71
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,640
are meant to save lives,

72
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,080
never to harm them.

73
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,200
Father.

74
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,800
It's not too late.

75
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,560
Let's submit the evidence together

76
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:37,800
and bring the guilty to justice.

77
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,440
Let's go.

78
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:42,520
You fool.

79
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,640
You think I don't know

80
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:46,000
you're taking these

81
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,800
to Consort Rong?

82
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,440
Consort Qi already ordered me

83
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:52,360
to keep you in line.

84
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,440
Father.

85
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,080
I'm doing this

86
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,840
for the innocent,

87
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,640
for the souls Consort Qi killed

88
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,440
that no one knows about.

89
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,560
I'm doing what's right!

90
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:04,760
Right?

91
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,160
Fine.

92
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:10,480
You say I got tangled in harem fights.

93
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,000
What about you?

94
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,520
You've been working for Consort Rong,
haven't you?

95
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,280
What?

96
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,680
Have you lost your mind over that woman?

97
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:22,440
I told you not to join
the Imperial Hospital,

98
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,720
but you wouldn't listen.

99
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:26,000
You entered the palace for her,
didn't you?

100
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,320
You've stayed unmarried all these years

101
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,320
because of her, too.

102
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,000
Right?

103
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
My hands are clean.

104
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,800
My conscience is clear.

105
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,680
In everything I've done,

106
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,960
I answer to His Majesty above

107
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:39,360
and to every patient below.

108
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,840
Every prescription I write

109
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,680
is to save lives,

110
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,440
never to harm.

111
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,080
I've been true to my conscience.

112
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,120
Did that hit a nerve?

113
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:53,160
You collude with Consort Qi,

114
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:54,800
and serve as accomplices to evil.

115
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,760
It won't end well for either of you.

116
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,040
Father.

117
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,800
Please listen to me.

118
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,040
Stop now.

119
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,040
Don't obey Consort Qi anymore.

120
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,680
For an outsider,

121
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:10,400
would you destroy our whole family?

122
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,760
Father, you're wrong.

123
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,680
I'm not doing this for an outsider.

124
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,720
I'm doing it so the dead
won't have died in vain,

125
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,240
and the living won't have to
live in fear.

126
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:27,400
I've always lived by your teachings.

127
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,040
A physician must have compassion.

128
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,520
Your Highness.

129
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,800
Consort Qi's true face is exposed.

130
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,200
But her side has been quiet these days.

131
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,880
I can't help feeling

132
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,320
a little uneasy.

133
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,080
Consort Qi is sly and hypocritical.

134
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,280
If we do nothing,

135
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,560
she's the one who should be panicking.

136
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,280
You're right, Your Highness.

137
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,360
I heard

138
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,600
that before the late Empress died,

139
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,840
she asked His Majesty
to look after Consort Qi.

140
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,880
Later, Consort Qi rose from maid

141
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,480
to Cairen.

142
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,320
The eldest prince was young then

143
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,320
and only clung to her.

144
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,960
So His Majesty,

145
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,840
for her to raise the eldest prince well,

146
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,080
had her

147
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,440
promoted several ranks

148
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,520
to consort.

149
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,320
Your Highness.

150
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,720
Consort Qi is very calculating.

151
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,840
She's raised the eldest prince
for years.

152
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,520
His Majesty owes her for that.

153
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,120
If we try to take her on,

154
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,200
she may well be right.

155
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,040
Maybe we can't touch her.

156
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,600
There's something

157
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,320
I haven't told you.

158
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,640
The eldest prince once told me

159
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:59,600
he found his mother's death suspicious.

160
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,280
What?

161
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,600
The eldest prince said that?

162
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,320
Consort Rong, please wait.

163
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,280
Consort Rong.

164
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:14,240
Thank you for saving me last night.

165
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,720
You are too kind.

166
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,000
I simply couldn't stand by

167
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,000
and let you and Concubine Rou
fall into their trap.

168
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,840
I just did what I should.

169
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,880
Consort Rong.

170
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:24,120
You truly are the clearest mind
in this harem.

171
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,800
If my mother hadn't been framed

172
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,160
and died so mysteriously,

173
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,280
if she'd lived to today,

174
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,480
she and you would surely
have been close friends.

175
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:34,080
Why do you say that, Your Highness?

176
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,880
I'll take my leave now.

177
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,160
But the eldest prince

178
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,400
was raised by Consort Qi.

179
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,960
It seems you were right.

180
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,720
The eldest prince is no fool.

181
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,440
Speaking of it,
the late Empress's illness

182
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,360
was improving.

183
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:57,840
But somehow,

184
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,280
her condition took a turn for the worse,

185
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,640
and she passed away.

186
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,120
Of all the attendants
in her palace then,

187
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,960
only Consort Qi remains today.

188
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,640
The others simply vanished

189
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,960
without a trace.

190
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,440
Some say

191
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,560
they left the palace.

192
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,040
Others say

193
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,640
they all died.

194
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,400
I can't help thinking

195
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,400
there's something strange about it.

196
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,280
So it seems

197
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,200
the eldest prince

198
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,160
said that to me on purpose.

199
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,920
He wanted me to know

200
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,600
that the late Empress's death

201
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,720
was suspicious.

202
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,600
Could it be

203
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,360
that Consort Qi killed the late Empress?

204
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,920
Your Highness.

205
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,120
Your Highness.

206
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,120
Physician Li, you seem hurried.

207
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,280
Is there something urgent?

208
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,480
Your Highness.

209
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,200
I'll take my leave.

210
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,560
Your Highness.

211
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,000
This is...

212
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,760
My father was once director
of the Imperial Hospital.

213
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,840
This is a copy he secretly kept

214
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,400
of the late Empress's old records.

215
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,040
Back then, my father learned

216
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,520
harem secrets he shouldn't have known.

217
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,720
To protect himself,

218
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,680
(Meridian Records of the Late Empress)
he pleaded illness and retired.

219
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,320
But he's never had peace of mind.

220
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,720
Recently, Consort Qi
threatened him again.

221
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,840
So he wanted to burn these old records.

222
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,240
I knew these records
were of great importance,

223
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,640
so I brought them to you,

224
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,880
in case they might be of use.

225
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,200
You're giving me

226
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,920
something that could
cost your father's life

227
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,080
and your whole family's survival.

228
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,160
You put it in my hands.

229
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,160
Aren't you afraid that,
to avenge my daughter,

230
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,480
I'd sacrifice you too?

231
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:47,920
A physician

232
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,880
must put healing and saving lives first,

233
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,440
and uphold what is right.

234
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,680
I've practiced medicine for years.

235
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,360
All I've sought is a clean name.

236
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,880
If I hid the truth to protect my family,

237
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:58,600
then all my skills

238
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,800
and my conscience

239
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:05,070
would be stained.

240
00:10:12,638 --> 00:10:15,164
(Chronic cough, weak qi, irregular
periods, lung-spleen deficiency.)

241
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,040
(The late Empress really was murdered.)

242
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:21,080
(She died at the hands
of someone she trusted most.)

243
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,720
(Prescription)

244
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,240
(Codonopsis 3 qian, atractylodes 3 qian)
Her own child

245
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,240
(is being raised by her foe.)

246
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,000
(How ironic.)

247
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,480
(Red walls and golden tiles
hide all filth.)

248
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:35,000
(Beneath silken splendor
lies every wicked heart.)

249
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,600
(I will tear off Consort Qi's
shameless mask)

250
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,320
(and drag every dirty deed she's done)

251
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,200
(into the light)

252
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:45,120
(for all to see.)

253
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:52,800
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

254
00:10:53,173 --> 00:10:57,653
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

255
00:10:58,087 --> 00:11:02,367
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

256
00:11:02,801 --> 00:11:07,280
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

257
00:11:07,727 --> 00:11:12,040
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

258
00:11:12,627 --> 00:11:17,080
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

259
00:11:17,428 --> 00:11:21,880
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

260
00:11:22,304 --> 00:11:26,800
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

261
00:11:27,094 --> 00:11:31,560
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

262
00:11:32,149 --> 00:11:35,100
♪Let the stars and sea♪

263
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,760
(Changsheng Gate)

264
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:40,600
♪Wait for your return♪
